fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-19T14:38:15.7288738Z Note: a multi-user installation is possible. See https://nix.dev/manual/nix/stable/installation/installing-binary.html#multi-user-installation
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-19T14:38:15.7296782Z ^[[1;31mSwitching to the Multi-user Installer^[[0m
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-19T14:38:15.7382147Z ^[[32mWelcome to the Multi-User Nix Installation
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-19T14:38:15.7390900Z ^[[0m
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-19T14:38:15.7391954Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-19T14:38:15.7392747Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-19T14:38:15.7393159Z 
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-19T14:38:15.7393562Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-19T14:38:15.7394868Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-19T14:38:15.7395314Z 
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-19T14:38:15.7395678Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-19T14:38:15.7396375Z    if you are ready to continue.
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-19T14:38:15.7396901Z 
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-19T14:38:15.7397550Z 3. Create the system users ^[[34m(uids [30001..30008])^[[0m and groups ^[[34m(gid 30000)^[[0m
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-19T14:38:15.7398512Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-19T14:38:15.7399178Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-19T14:38:15.7399649Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-19T14:38:15.7399946Z 
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-19T14:38:15.7400266Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-19T14:38:15.7400605Z 
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-19T14:38:15.7400865Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-19T14:38:15.7401542Z    can use Nix.
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-19T14:38:15.7401829Z 
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-19T14:38:15.7402066Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-19T14:38:15.7402401Z 
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-19T14:38:15.7402925Z ^[[32m^[[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-19T14:38:15.7403563Z ^[[0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-19T14:38:15.7403882Z 
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-19T14:38:15.7404101Z I will:
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-19T14:38:15.7404457Z 
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-19T14:38:15.7404803Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-19T14:38:15.7405544Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-19T14:38:15.7406364Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-19T14:38:15.7407317Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-19T14:38:15.7407909Z  - install Nix in /nix
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-19T14:38:15.7408456Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-19T14:38:15.7409023Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-19T14:38:15.7409465Z    /root
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-19T14:38:15.7415526Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-19T14:38:15.7417652Z  - update /etc/bash.bashrc to include some Nix configuration
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-19T14:38:15.7426075Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-19T14:38:15.7427055Z    and /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.socket) for nix-daemon
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-19T14:38:15.7427356Z 
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-19T14:38:15.7427948Z ^[[32m^[[4;32mReady to continue?
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-19T14:38:15.7428621Z ^[[0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-19T14:38:15.7443417Z 
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-19T14:38:15.7444546Z ^[[34m---- let's talk about sudo -----------------------------------------------------
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-19T14:38:15.7452075Z ^[[0mThis script is going to call sudo a lot. Normally, it would show you
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-19T14:38:15.7453138Z exactly what commands it is running and why. However, the script is
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-19T14:38:15.7453879Z run in a headless fashion, like this:
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-19T14:38:15.7454184Z 
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-19T14:38:15.7454606Z   $ curl -L https://nixos.org/nix/install | sh
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-19T14:38:15.7455307Z 
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-19T14:38:15.7455785Z or maybe in a CI pipeline. Because of that, I'm going to skip the
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-19T14:38:15.7456439Z verbose output in the interest of brevity.
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-19T14:38:15.7457027Z 
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-19T14:38:15.7457184Z If you would like to
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-19T14:38:15.7457572Z see the output, try like this:
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-19T14:38:15.7457804Z 
